<title>CAMBODIA: SOCCER-YEMEN BEAT CAMBODIA IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-YEMEN BEAT CAMBODIA IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>PHNOM PENH 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yemen beat Cambodia 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in a World Cup soccer Asian zone group 5 qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Esam Dariban 40.</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,000</p>
<p>    Standings	P   W   D   L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> Indonesia	   2   1   1   0   8   0    4</p>
<p> Yemen		 2   1   1   0   1   0    4</p>
<p> Cambodia	    2   0   0   2   0   9    0</p>
<p> Uzbekistan	  0   0   0   0   0   0    0</p>
<p>Next match: Cambodia v Indonesia, April 27.</p>
</text>
